{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02077","headline":"杂曲歌辞 大酺乐 一 · 杜审言","name":"杂曲歌辞 大酺乐 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣后乘乾日，皇明御历辰。\n紫宫初啓坐，苍璧正临春。\n雷雨垂膏泽，金钱赐下人。\n诏酺欢赏徧，交泰覩惟新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}